# Markdownlint Ignore Patterns

## Ignore VCS and editor metadata

.git/
.vscode/

## Ignore local Python environment and caches

.venv/
.ruff_cache/

## Ignore JavaScript dependencies and build artifacts

node_modules/
dist/
coverage/

## Ignore Copilot generated local memory/log artifacts

.github/copilot/memory/
.github/copilot/agent-memory/
.github/copilot/agent-logs/

## Ignore any doNotLint folder under .github (any depth)

.github/**/doNotLint/
.github/**/doNotLint/**

## Ignore imported awesome-copilot instruction files

.github/instructions/code-review-generic.instructions.md
.github/instructions/gilfoyle-code-review.instructions.md
.github/instructions/markdown.instructions.md
.github/instructions/self-explanatory-code-commenting.instructions.md
